# TOOLS — {{ name }}

Primary tool: the **selves-brain** skill (shell exec of the `selves` CLI, or curl to
`$SELVES_BRAIN_URL`).

Allowed commands for this agent:
{% if agent_id.startswith("self-") %}
- `selves session current` / `selves session show`
- `selves recall --as {{ era.id }} -q "..."`
- `selves voice --as {{ era.id }}`
{% elif agent_id == "historian" %}
- `selves session current` / `selves session show`
- `selves history -q "..."`
{% elif agent_id == "chair" %}
- `selves session new "..."` / `selves session current` / `selves session show`
- `selves recall --as now -q "..."`
- `selves history -q "..."`
- `selves record decision`
- `selves due`
{% endif %}

Runtime note: agents need shell exec to run `selves`. If OpenClaw exec is blocked or
flaky, pin this agent to the Claude Code runtime (`- **Runtime:** claude`, which needs
`ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`) — it runs shell and file writes natively.

Do NOT enable the cognee-openclaw plugin's autoRecall on self agents; it would inject
cross-era memory and break time isolation.
